{"id": "EUVD-2026-98024", "enisaUuid": "a38df652-5ad8-3331-99e5-ad96a561d6eb", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.119.1 and 16.x before 16.32.0 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability because content submitted through a public-facing booking page is stored without neutralization. Unauthenticated attackers can submit crafted content that is rendered as raw HTML in a privileged user's session, executing script to act as that user and take over the account.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:45:24", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-rv4r-c8v3-3hrc", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.119.1-stored-xss-via-public-booking-page"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rcfr-6r59-hm5x", "CVE-2026-109633"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "656f9339-d151-3f45-8dfe-6674447ac5ad", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.32.0"}, {"id": "cc2ed963-07d7-3404-8b19-10445cc09c9f", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.119.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "aacfbcee-e0a7-3636-9fe1-5570486a0f3d", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}